Geometry sweep: within-bifolium quintile contrast (lowest minus highest diversity fifth) for pool shapes; cohort = tokens with the
study selector valid and the 100 containing windows inside the bifolium; a pool shape's row uses the tokens where its predictor is
defined (component diversity needs five pair-bearing words in the pool; word diversity any pool). MS rec with a 95% interval.
Columns: MS rec = manuscript; MS syn = manuscript (synthetic boxes); w-par = words shuffled in paragraphs (size-matched); w-page = words shuffled in pages (size-matched); w-bif = words shuffled in bifolia (size-matched); w-all = words shuffled in whole manuscript (size-matched); w-par-any = words shuffled in paragraphs (any length, fitted letter size); w-line = words shuffled in lines; rev = lines reversed; rot = lines rotated (diagonal); l-par = lines shuffled in paragraphs (fitted letter size); l-page = lines shuffled in pages (fitted letter size); Timm pg = Timm page draw s1; Timm view = Timm in view s1; noinn view = no-innov in view s1

